  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759130,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 100 Classic Book Collection: Alice's Black Beauty - Nintendo DS\n\nStep into a portable literary world with *100 Classic Book Collection: Alice's Black Beauty* for the Nintendo DS! This unique e-book collection, developed by Genius Sonority and published by Nintendo, brings the beloved story of *Black Beauty* by Anna Sewell to life on your handheld console. Experience the poignant tale of a horse's journey through life, encountering both kindness and cruelty, all within a charming, book-like interface.\n\nHold your DS like a traditional book and customize your reading experience with adjustable text sizes and background music. Bookmark your progress and easily resume where you left off. Utilize the search function to quickly locate specific passages or explore other titles within the expansive 100 Classic Book Collection. Discover introductions and author information to enrich your understanding of the story. \n\nThis educational and engaging title offers a unique way to rediscover classic literature, perfect for both seasoned readers and those new to the world of Victorian fiction. Relive the adventures of *Black Beauty* and explore a library of timeless tales, all conveniently housed within a single game cartridge."
    },
